{
  "name": "Find and verify a business email with ClearBounce",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find and verify a business email with ClearBounce\n\nTurns a name and company domain into a verified email address.\n\n1. **Find** (free) looks the person up and returns the best match plus pattern candidates.\n2. **Verify** (1 credit) checks the best match before you send anything.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a ClearBounce API credential with a live key (`cb_live_`).\n2. Edit **Lead** with a real name and domain, or replace it with your CRM, a Google Sheet or a form.\n3. Click **Execute workflow**.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000001",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000002",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-0000000000a1",
              "name": "fullName",
              "value": "Nathan Smith",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-0000000000a2",
              "name": "domain",
              "value": "example.com",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000003",
      "name": "Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "find",
        "fullName": "={{ $json.fullName }}",
        "domain": "={{ $json.domain }}"
      },
      "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000004",
      "name": "Find Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-clearbounce.clearBounce",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-0000000000c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email || ($json.candidates || [])[0] || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000005",
      "name": "Address Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "email": "={{ $json.email || $json.candidates[0] }}"
      },
      "id": "c3f5e4f2-0003-4e3a-9c30-000000000006",
      "name": "Verify Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-clearbounce.clearBounce",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        -100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Lead",
